          "text": "12",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lwito lwamwa Abulamu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lu'siku' lu'mo, Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Abulamu, “Wu'ka u'fume mu nsi' i'yi' wikalile, u'v'aleke v'adu'gu'yo na mugana gwamwa so, u'ye ku' lwandi' u'lo ndaku'lagi'le.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hu' vyene Abulamu wawu'kaga ku' kaya yeni'yo ya Halani ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga. Itungo lyeni'lo wasangwa wafikyaga musimo gwa myaka maku'mi mupungati' na itano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abulamu wamusolaga Salai muki' wakwe haki'mo na Loto mwana wa muyagi mudu'gu'ye, na v'akumba av'o v'av'apandi'kile kwenu'ko, haki'mo na nsawo zyav'o zyose i'zyo v'av'age nazyo ku' Halani, nav'o v'ayu'mbaga ku'ya ku' nsi' ya Kanaani na v'afikaga kwenu'ko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abulamu haki'mo na mugana gwakwe v'av'i'taga hagati' na Kanaani, nav'o v'afikaga ha lwandi' u'lo hav'age na muti' muhanya gwa mwaloni u'go gwav'age ku' Mole, bi'hi' na kaya ya Shekemu. Ha itungo lyeni'lo V'akanaani hu' v'av'age v'ikazi v'a nsi' yeni'yo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wamwifumi'i'laga Abulamu na wamuwi'laga ati', “V'av'yalwa v'ako ndav'ape nsi' yeni'yi'.” Nawe Abulamu aho wigagwa vyeni'vyo wamuzyengelaga Gu'ku' Mulungu ihozezyo, ku'nguno yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu u'yo wamwifumi'i'laga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku'fuma kwenu'ko Abulamu walondaga ku' ngu'lu' zya lwandi' lwa mu ki'ya ya kaya ya Beteli, na wazyengaga nkambi' yakwe. Beteli yav'age lwandi' lwa mu mweli na Ai yav'age lwandi' lwa mu ki'ya. Kwenu'ko nako wamuzyengelaga Gu'ku' Mulungu ihozezyo na ku'mwisenga ku' lina lyakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Abulamu wendeleyaga na musi'nzo ku'ya ku' lwandi' lwa dakama mu ibalangu' lya Negebu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abulamu mu nsi' ya Misili",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha itungo lyeni'lo yasangwa yagwa nzala ndaki ku' lwandi' lwenu'lo, nawe Abulamu yamudimaga ku'ya ku' lwandi' lwa dakama ku' nsi' ya Misili, ku'kikala ha itungo lyeni'lo lya nzala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wegelaga kwingi'la mu nsi' ya Misili wamuwi'laga muki' wakwe Salai, “Degeleka, manyile ku'v'a u'li' muki'ma musoga na wa kwiv'elelwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U'lu' v'aku'wone V'amisili v'aku'yomba, ‘U'yu' ali' muki' wakwe,’ haho v'aku'mbu'laga, sumbwa ev'e v'aku'ku'leka u'li' mupanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku'nguno yeni'yo u'v'awi'le ati', ene ni' ilu'mbu'yo, ki'gele mpandi'ke wu'soga haki'mo na wu'zuwu'ku wanne viv'e ku'nguno yako.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Abulamu wafikaga ku' Misili, V'amisili v'amuwonaga Salai ku'v'a ali' muki'ma musoga muno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "V'ahanya v'a hamwa Falao",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12:15",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Lina Falao li'li' isumbi' lya wu'temi ku' Misili.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", mutemi wa Misili, aho v'amuwonaga Salai, v'amukumi'li'zyaga ku' mutemi wav'o. Haho Salai wafilagwa ku' iku'lu'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku'nguno yamwa Salai, Falao wamuv'ezezyaga Abulamu wu'soga. Wamupaga ng'ombe, nkolo, mbu'li, mpunda, ntwangawu'lende na v'akumba v'a ki'gosya na v'a ki'ki'ma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi Gu'ku' Mulungu wamutusyaga Falao na v'antu' v'a mu lu'go lwakwe v'ose ku' malwile mahanya ku'nguno ya ku'musola Salai, muki' wamwa Abulamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Falao wamwitanaga Abulamu na ku'muwu'zya, “Wambezezyaga ki'? Ku' ki' u'kambwi'lile ati' Salai ali' muki' wako? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku' ki' wayombile ati', ali' ilu'mbu'yo, ninga waleka namusola av'e muki' wanne? Haya musole muki' wako u'hafume henanha!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' mutemi Falao wav'alagi'li'zyaga v'antu' v'akwe ku'mufili'li'zya Abulamu na muki' wakwe, na vintu' vyose i'vyo wav'age navyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
